<title>RUSSIA: Lenenergo, Preussenelektra plan talks.</title>
<headline>Lenenergo, Preussenelektra plan talks.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>AOOT Lenenergo, which supplies power to the St Petersburg region, plans talks in early September with Veba AG's Preussenelektra utility on cooperation and joint projects, Lenenergo said on Friday.</p>
<p>Lenenergo deputy chief executive Oleg Zaitsev told Reuters Preussenelektra already owns more than five percent of Lenenergo.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
